{"id":"8095564103754","handle":"pleated-chiffon-cap-sleeve-bridesmaid-dress-es02695","title":"ever NEMI|Pleated Chiffon Cap Sleeve Bridesmaid Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>If you want a wedding-ready dress that feels light and looks polished in photos, this one nails it. The cap sleeves give just enough shoulder coverage while keeping the neckline open and feminine. A softly ruched bodice adds texture and helps shape the bust without feeling restrictive. The wide waistband defines the waist and keeps the fit secure, while the chiffon maxi skirt falls in a clean A line that moves beautifully when you walk, pose, or dance. It’s an easy pick for bridesmaids, and it also works well for formal wedding guests who want something elegant but not fussy.</p>\n<p><strong>Why it works</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cap sleeves for subtle shoulder coverage</li>\n<li>Ruched bodice that flatters the bust and photographs well</li>\n<li>Defined waistband for a more shaped waist</li>\n<li>Flowy A line chiffon maxi skirt for breathable comfort</li>\n<li>Easy for outdoor weddings and long receptions</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Best for</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bridesmaids and mix and match wedding parties</li>\n<li>Beach and destination weddings</li>\n<li>Garden ceremonies and outdoor venues</li>\n<li>Formal wedding guest outfits and evening receptions</li>\n<li>Engagement photos rehearsal dinners and bridal showers</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: Floor-length.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Sleeveless.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Back zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: It is not padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises chiffon.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is high stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Bridesmaid Dresses","tags":["3days","A-Line","Apple","Bridesmaid Dresses","Cap Sleeve","Chiffon Dresses","Cold Shoulder","Deep 